OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fshowers are likely this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, however showers will become
OL,8,Fless frequent with some clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Strong and gusty coastal
OL,10,Fwinds will ease. A warm night for many.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA cloudy start on Sunday with
OL,13,Fsunny spells soon giving way to
OL,14,Fshowers, these will prove heavy, with
OL,15,Fthunder and hail during the afternoon
OL,16,Fand evening. Temperatures close to
OL,17,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
